s.write on a desktop layout pressed Delete in the detail of an Asset.","The base state is the confirmation for the Asset Header logo, whose current revision has been read.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the dialog is centered over a dimmed ground."],"intent":"Show the Delete Asset confirmation of the Asset detail as built from Adapter Widgets only: asking before an Asset is removed, listing the Views whose `$asset` bindings would dangle, and what the dialog says when the deletion is held up.","interactionRules":["The first request carries no acknowledgement; when `$asset` bindings would dangle, nothing is deleted and the dialog lists them, and only Delete anyway deletes, after the person has read them.","Deleting changes nothing that refers to the Asset: the references stay as they are and are reported as missing afterwards, and earlier versions stay in History.","The deletion expects the revision read when the dialog opened; a newer revision, an edit lease held by someone else, a missing permission key or another refusal says so, deletes nothing and offers Reload or Retry."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"relation":"opened-from","type":"view","viewId":"d8e4c202-4d5e-4f60-9b72-8d9eafb0c104"}],"requirements":["01a1144e-50dd-7b92-aa5e-e175e34bf424"]},"variants":{"conflict":{"requirements":["01a11485-f451-72eb-81ad-686aeec7b3eb"],"state":{"cancel":{"visible":false},"close":{"visible":true},"confirm":{"visible":false},"confirm-text":{"visible":false},"conflict":{"visible":true},"reload":{"visible":true}}},"deleting":{"state":{"cancel":{"disabled":true},"confirm":{"loading":true}}},"impact":{"requirements":["01a172ce-280b-7cec-9ca5-ec189b313ebe","01a172ce-31eb-7b81-afd6-ddd6855cc30e"],"state":{"confirm-wrap":{"visible":false},"impact